 "reporting": "Percent resistant (%R) with number tested per drug, by organism and specimen (blood, urine, pus aspirate, other sterile body fluids), all locations pooled; blood %R by location (inpatient and emergency, outpatient, ICU) as chart data labels without numbers tested. Isolate counts by specimen and by location.",
